Hi,

The Nullpointer exception is thrown when trying to use a toolchain tarball
which has DISTRO set to something else than poky.
This would generate the name *${DISTRO}sdk* in the sysroot under /opt/${DIS=
TRO}/1.2/sysroots/

Br,
David


